stateDiagram-v2
    direction LR
    [*] --> PENDING: Requester creates
    PENDING --> VERIFIED: Moderator/Volunteer validates
    PENDING --> REJECTED: Invalid / Spam
    PENDING --> CANCELLED: Requester cancels
    VERIFIED --> SEARCHING: Auto-broadcast begins
    SEARCHING --> DONOR_RESPONDED: Donor accepts
    DONOR_RESPONDED --> SEARCHING: Donor withdraws
    DONOR_RESPONDED --> ARRANGED: Requester confirms donor
    ARRANGED --> COMPLETED: Donation verified
    ARRANGED --> SEARCHING: Arrangement falls through
    SEARCHING --> EXPIRED: Past required_by date
    DONOR_RESPONDED --> EXPIRED: Past required_by date
    COMPLETED --> [*]
    CANCELLED --> [*]
    EXPIRED --> [*]
    REJECTED --> [*]
